{
  "launch_and_read": "Two independently reset (0,R,0) launches, three signed Hadamard ticks with the physical departure translation g_k(x)=kx mod M. Read position, direction, and physical sheet coordinate in each run. A line base or C_lcm(8,M) suffices.",
  "predeclared_event": "Both base readouts equal the same port in {(1,R),(-1,L)}, and the two sheets have distance exactly 2 in the independently fixed unoriented unit-edge cycle.",
  "three_tick_integer_paths": [
    {
